    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S</strong>TORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now that a snowstorm has devastated the region, the only way to continue your journey is through the castle of the mysterious Baron Fetuccini. <br>Arriving at the castle, you discover a nightmare from which it seems impossible to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore varied labyrinthine environments in a non-linear way, solve puzzles and riddles, and carefully manage your resources in this survival horror game where the slightest encounter can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is also a precious resource. Be careful, when night falls, you could find yourself facing the most dangerous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLVE THE MYSTERIES OF THE CASTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other characters who are also trapped on the island. Assisting them may help you unlock the secrets behind the mysterious Funskin project.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S</strong>TORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now that a snowstorm has devastated the region, the only way to continue your journey is through the castle of the mysterious Baron Fetuccini. <br>Arriving at the castle, you discover a nightmare from which it seems impossible to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore varied labyrinthine environments in a non-linear way, solve puzzles and riddles, and carefully manage your resources in this survival horror game where the slightest encounter can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is also a precious resource. Be careful, when night falls, you could find yourself facing the most dangerous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLVE THE MYSTERIES OF THE CASTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other characters who are also trapped on the island. Assisting them may help you unlock the secrets behind the mysterious Funskin project.</p>",
    "short_description": "A horrifying experience in a strange and timeless universe. Explore, solve puzzles, fight for your survival and try to escape this nightmare.",
